{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A pull request command in a queue-enabled repository is silently dropped, leaving the requested run unstarted."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Enabling the queue with an empty or quiet issue set can silently skip a new command or execute a stale one."},{"id":"F3","consequence":"bypass","trigger":"unusual","reason":"A trusted factory bot can bypass the claimed own-comment exclusion when identity lookup fails."},{"id":"F4","consequence":"nuisance","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Trusted webhook hints cause extra failed API calls during rate limiting and defeat the scheduled retry interval."},{"id":"F5","consequence":"test","trigger":"normal","reason":"The restart test reuses its in-memory store and does not verify persistence across reopening, although the disk-reopen probe passed."},{"id":"F6","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A valid command quoting the factory marker is silently skipped, leaving the requested work undone."}]}